-- REM-A7-UIA-FIXES-2 (2026-10-26, remediation agent rem-a7 fork F4; charter pillar research; agent_issues 100576 and 100140, UIA-SOURCE-FIDELITY-1 items 2 and 4; follows migrations/2026-10-26-rem-a7-uia-fixes.sql).
-- Owner directive 2026-10-26 ("this issue should be handled automatically", ops_config OWNER_DIRECTIVE_2026_10_26_UIA_SOURCE_FIDELITY_AUTO_1) authorises all seven items, with rule c for the judgement edits: use the narrowest statement the papers support, add no contribution fact, name the choice in change_reason.
--   Item 2 (ignorance-ai-pipeline-synthesis v0.2.1 -> v0.2.2): two sentences of Section 2 say the human 'added entire missing dimensions' and that the AI's frame 'omitted' them, while the first extraction already named all four. They now say the first extraction had
